  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Simply Exponential Firstaid Responder &amp; Janitorial Service Training Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the arrival of the novel coronavirus, USADF and LSETF collaborated to conduct a Request for Proposals focused on healthcare services, infection control and sanitation, and PPE production. Simply Exponential Consult Limited, through a competitive application process, was chosen to receive grant financing from USADF and LSETF. Simply Exponential Consult Limited is proposing training for 100 unemployed Lagos State residents to become Healthcare assistants and Sanitation Officers. They will train 100 students over a 6 week curriculum leading to employment opportunities through connections with the Nigerian Association of Small Scale Industrialists, Fate Foundation Alumni Association, NECAs Network of Entrepreneurial Women, and the Lagos Chamber of Commerce and Industry.</narrative>
  </description>
